    <string name="risk_info_title">How is this calculated?</string>
    <string name="risk_info_text">Your risk level comes from your last 5 saved scans (at least 3 are needed).\n\nCritical: 3 or more high-severity scans.\nHigh: 2 or more high-severity scans, or 3 or more medium-severity scans.\nMedium: 1 high-severity scan, or 2 medium-severity scans.\nLow: anything else.\n\nA scan\'s severity comes from how confident the AI is about its worst finding. This is a screening aid, not a medical diagnosis.</string>

